      "created_at": "2021-07-12T15:20:03.996Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am running a game for my friends and most of the characters they’ve made have a more “Suicide Squad”/ “Anti-Hero” vibe about them. So my question is: If they were to get into a fight with say the Freedom Five or Dark Watch, would it be best to make villain sheets for them, hero sheets for them or treat them like high level Lieutinents?</p>",
