      "created_at": "2021-07-12T15:32:12.458Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would recommend stat-ing any enemies that are meant to be fought by your players as “Villains” or Lieutenants, as those are mechanically meant for that purpose, whereas Heroes have a lot more going on and might prove difficult for a single GM to manage.</p>\n<p>(I believe there was another thread that asked this same question, but I can’t seem to find it.)</p>",
